    "['ipv4-family', [{'para_map': [], 'trans_command': 'address-family ipv4 vrf vpna', 'parent_command': ['l2vpn evpn instance [parameter1]'], 'root': 'l2vpn evpn instance [parameter1]', 'source': 'llm', 'origin_reponse': \"##\\naddress-family ipv4 vrf vpna\\n##\\n\\nThe Cisco equivalent of Huawei's `ipv4-family` command within a VPN instance context is `address-family ipv4 vrf [vpn-instance-name]`. This enters the IPv4 address family configuration mode for the specified VRF (equivalent to Huawei's VPN instance).\", 'trans_template': 'address-family ipv4 vrf vpna'}]]": 1,
